OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother cold feeling day, with
OL,6,Fa strengthening breeze. A mixture of
OL,7,Fcloud and sunny spells, with any early
OL,8,Frain over high ground in the northwest
OL,9,Fsoon clearing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FPartly cloudy with a strong
OL,12,Fbreeze tonight. Feeling cold, with
OL,13,Fhill fog over high ground and a
OL,14,Fwidespread grass frost.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FA dry and frosty start with
OL,17,Fearly hill fog over high ground. Cloud
OL,18,Fwill thicken from late morning,
OL,19,Fbringing outbreaks of rain spreading
OL,20,Feastward, with a gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
