OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FUnsettled with rain or showers and
OL,7,Fstrong winds at times. Some drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter intervals. Turning colder
OL,9,Fagain with a risk of snow on higher
OL,10,Fground Monday night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
